{
  "_doc": "Executable copy of product/decisions.md D3.5. Each row: one request (method, path, query, body, headers) and, per mode, the expected status, error code (JSON `error`, or JSON-RPC error/result error for MCP), whether Retry-After is present. `quota`: yes = counts against the shared daily budget, no = does not, separate = own beacon budget (checked in mode off by spending the row 3x against QUOTA_DAILY=3 and probing a valid query). `discovery`: listed in /openapi.json + llms.txt (+ MCP tools/list for tools) in mode off; null = n/a. `setup`: exhaust_daily | exhaust_allowance | rate_minute | trip_breaker. Placeholders: {release}, {long}. Modes: off = PAYMENTS=off; on = PAYMENTS=on valid config; on-bad = PAYMENTS=on, no PAY_TO; preview-off = PREVIEW=off; breaker = BREAKER_DAILY tripped. Runner: test/matrix-runner.mjs (also scripts/route-matrix.mjs for the live smoke, checklist step 16).",
